\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The day of resurrection!
\par Earth, tell it abroad;
\par The Passover of gladness,
\par The Passover of God!
\par From death to life eternal,
\par From earth unto the sky,
\par Our Christ hath brought us over
\par With hymns of victory.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our hearts be pure from evil,
\par That we may see aright
\par The Lord in rays eternal
\par Of resurrection light,
\par And, listening to His accents,
\par May hear, so calm and plain,
\par His own All hail! And hearing,
\par May raise the victor-strain.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Now let the heavens be joyful;
\par Let earth her song begin;
\par The round world keep high triumph,
\par And all that is therein;
\par Let all things seen and unseen,
\par Their notes of gladness blend:
\par For Christ the Lord hath risen,
\par Our joy that hath no end.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

